      <span class="mgdb-eyebrow">About MaizeGDB</span>
      <h1 id="cite-title">How to cite MaizeGDB</h1>
      <p>Citations in the literature are how we demonstrate that MaizeGDB is a useful resource. Please cite the reference below rather than linking to the site alone, which we cannot track.</p>
